{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan-review remediation for story 749c: first review BLOCKED on missing data flow from ticket file_impact_scope to build_manifest and an ungrounded resign claim. Revised the ticket before claim to specify sign_plan_review as the store-read/classification boundary; manifest.py remains dependency-light; build_manifest receives a backward-compatible file_scope keyword; resign_plan_review inherits behavior through its existing signer call. Also pinned none-only fingerprint encoding, legacy and rollback semantics, drift-floor ordering rationale, public helper exports, the 800-line cap, and behavior/contract-only tests. Updated file impact to include the three observable-contract test modules; removed the unsupported plan_review.__init__ change."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785221452867728001,"uuid":"513f6994-4a10-41b9-b888-f0f83ee20eb8"}